  - m_Id: 11369296334848
    m_Localized: "\nB\u0130R MAVERIA\nOYUNUDUR\n\n\n-PROJE Y\xD6NET\u0130M\u0130-\nProje
      Sorumlusu / Dan\u0131\u015Fman:\nMUSTAFA HAKAN BOZKURT\n\n\n-GEL\u0130\u015ET\u0130RME
      EK\u0130B\u0130-\nBa\u015F Yaz\u0131l\u0131mc\u0131:\nMUHAMMET FURKAN B\u0130L\u0130C\u0130\nOyun
      Tasar\u0131m\u0131 & Mekanikleri:\nMUHAMMET FURKAN B\u0130L\u0130C\u0130\nUI/UX
      Tasar\u0131m\u0131 & Uygulamas\u0131:\nMUHAMMET FURKAN B\u0130L\u0130C\u0130\n\n\n-G\xD6RSEL
      VE SANATSAL VARLIKLAR-\n3D Modeller & Materyaller:\n\"Low Poly Wood Pack \u2013
      Stylized Wooden Models\" - MyUniverse Studio (Unity Asset Store \xFCzerinden)\n\"Low-Poly
      Simple Nature Pack\" - JustCreate (Unity Asset Store \xFCzerinden)\n\"Sparrow
      - Quirky Series\" - Omabuarts Studio (Unity Asset Store \xFCzerinden)\n\"Cartoon
      FX Remaster Free\" - Jean Moreno (Unity Asset Store \xFCzerinden)\n\n\n-M\xDCZ\u0130K
      & SES-\nOrijinal M\xFCzikler:\n\"8bit Music-062022\" - GWriterStudio\nSes Efektleri:\n\"RPG
      Essentials Sound Effects\" - leohpaz\n\"FREE UI Click Sound Pack\" - SwishSwoosh\n\n\n-TEKNOLOJ\u0130
      & \xD6ZEL TE\u015EEKK\xDCRLER-\nOyun Motoru:\nUnity Engine\nSunucu & \xC7evrimi\xE7i
      Hizmetler:\nLiderlik Tablolar\u0131 ve Oyuncu Verisi - LootLocker\nIP Konum
      Tespiti - ipinfo.com\n\n\n\xA9 2025 MAVERIA. T\xFCm Haklar\u0131 Sakl\u0131d\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
